import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" updated="October 21, 2026">
  <p>
    At Ekwly (operated by <strong>Lakshit Loy Dutta</strong>), we practice strict data minimization.
    This Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we secure it, and how you can permanently
    delete your account at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Account Identity:</strong> When you sign in via Google OAuth or Email Magic Link, we
      store your display name, email address, and profile avatar URL. You may also optionally save
      your UPI ID (VPA) so friends can settle bills with you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Bill &amp; Ledger Data:</strong> We store session items, tax brackets, member claims,
      and settlement ledger balances for the rooms you create or join.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Device Permissions (Camera):</strong> Camera access is used strictly on-demand when
      you scan a room/friend QR code (processed locally via on-device ML Kit) or capture a receipt
      photo for AI Magic Scan.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Zero Permanent Storage for Receipt Images (AI Magic Scan)</h2>
  <p>
    When you use the AI Magic Scan feature, your receipt image is compressed client-side on your
    device, transmitted over encrypted TLS 1.3 to our Supabase Edge Function, and processed
    in-memory by the Google Gemini Vision API to extract line items and taxes.{' '}
    <strong>We do not store your receipt photos in any cloud storage bucket or database.</strong>{' '}
    The image bytes are discarded immediately after extraction completes.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Security &amp; Encryption</h2>
  <p>
    All network traffic between the Ekwly Web PWA / Android / iOS apps and our backend is encrypted
    in transit using HTTPS/TLS 1.3 (with cleartext HTTP traffic strictly disabled). Database access
    is governed by PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS) policies.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Data Sharing &amp; Third-Party Processors</h2>
  <p>
    We never sell, rent, or share your personal data with advertisers. We rely only on essential
    infrastructure providers:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Supabase:</strong> PostgreSQL database, authentication, and realtime sync.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Gemini API:</strong> Ephemeral receipt OCR processing.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Razorpay / Google Play Billing:</strong> Subscription payment processing.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Account &amp; Data Deletion Rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can permanently delete your Ekwly account and wipe your profile, friend connections, and
    personal ledger records at any time directly inside the app (
    <strong>Profile &rarr; Delete Account Permanently</strong>) or on our web portal at{' '}
    <a href="/ekwly/delete-account">/delete-account</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Grievance Officer &amp; Contact</h2>
  <p>
    In accordance with the Information Technology Act, 2000 and rules made thereunder, the contact
    details of the Grievance Officer are:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Name:</strong> Lakshit Loy Dutta
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:lloy.dutta@gmail.com">lloy.dutta@gmail.com</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Location:</strong> Guwahati, Assam &amp; Bengaluru, Karnataka, India
    </li>
  </ul>
</LegalLayout>
